# Hotels Information

1. DIANI REEF RESORT AND SPA
-Location: P.O. Box 35, Ukunda – Diani Beach 80400, Kenya
-Description: Nestled in the pristine, white sands of the South Kenyan coastline, Diani Reef Beach Resort & Spa is the preferred getaway for luxury travellers looking to explore the uniquely enchanting experience of the serene beaches and Swahili culture that Kenya has to offer. Offering world-class hospitality standards, we are the perfect destination for beach holidays, corporate and social events as well as grand weddings. Experience this majestic splendor surrounded by spectacular sunsets and heavenly blues and hues, on the shores of the Indian Ocean. Karibu Diani Reef!
-Contact:
