4. PLANHOTEL HOSPITALITY GROUP
-Location: Diani Beach, P.O Box 84383 – 80100, Mombasa, Kenya
-Description: Founded in 1997 in Lugano, site of the Group’s headquarters, the Planhotel Hospitality Group has been operating in the tourism sector for over 18 years as a leading hotel management company for resorts and hotels in the Indian Ocean. The group focuses on management, marketing strategies and distribution, as well as developing the network of its Diamonds Resorts, Sandies Resorts & Hotels and Exploreans Camps & Lodges brands. Planhotel is renowned worldwide for its unique combination of local tradition and Italian style in both its design and guest services, without forgetting its exemplary all inclusive formula.
-Contact:
