5. SWAHILI BEACH RESORT AND SPA
-Location: PLOT 65, DIANI, KENYA.
-Description: With one of the best views in the resort, the Swahili Spa & Fitness Center has its own cove & indoor pool, 6 treatment rooms and a team of masseurs & beauticians to relax your mind, body & soul. From the indoor pool, Jacuzzi and range of award winning treatments, we have just the right mix to help you sit back and unwind.
